# This site's own data: what its pages say about themselves -- the
# site's name and address, the marks in its masthead and where they
# point, the landing-page blurb, the line under every page, the banner,
# the newsletter band, the picture a share of a coverless page carries.
# pelicanconf.py beside this file reads every key below into the
# settings the theme and the plugins render from, and holds nothing
# about what any of them mean: this is the one file to edit to change
# what this site is, and every key here carries what it is for.
#
# The exporter fills it from the archive's own site/site.toml, resolved
# for this site: the images it names are the copies this site carries,
# and what the exporter works out from several keys at once (the
# profile list, the masthead link's label) is written out as what it
# came to. A key this site does not set is commented out below, beside
# an example of it set, so this is also the list of what there is to
# set. The names tags and authors are shown under are the same
# arrangement one directory down, in data/*.json.

$site
